  "project_description": "Edit+ adds the Change tool to Edit Mode for the + Suite page builder .\n\n \n \n\n \n ▶ Watch an introduction to +Suite \n\n \nEdit+ adds the Change tool which provides inline editing functionality to Edit Mode . It allows users to see a thing, click a thing, change a thing. Edit's are powered by the normal entity form. You can form alter them or extend them as normal. There is a plugin system available to create slick inline editing widgets or the normal form item will be used inline.",
